      "text": "POST /record/sale\n{\ncheckout_id:  \nitems:[]{\n  item_id\n  count\n}\n}\n\nGET /top/categories?count=?\n-> []{\ncategory_id\nrank\n}\nGET /top/item/:item_id\n{\n []{\n  category_id:\n  rank\n}\n}\nGET /top/category/:category_id/items?count=?\n{\n[]{\n item_id\n rank\n}\n}\n",
